<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "Smart Investment: property price check before you buy | JobsDoor360",
      description: "Buying your first flat? Get a free, broker-neutral price snapshot for your city and budget, then a detailed price-trend report if you want one.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/smart-decisions/investment/",
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="sd-body" data-ga-module="smart_investment">
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/smart-decisions/investment/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="sd-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <div class="sd-wrap">
          <nav class="sd-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ga-section="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_home">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_smart_decisions">Smart Decisions</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" style="opacity:1;margin:0">Property investment</span></nav>
          <span class="sd-pill">FREE SNAPSHOT · NO BROKER PUSHING YOU</span>
          <h1>Is that flat priced fairly?</h1>
          <p>Before you put lakhs into a flat, it helps to know what the area is really worth. Tell us your city and budget and we'll give you a quick, honest picture, with no agent trying to close a deal.</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="sd-wrap sd-section">
        <section class="sd-panel" id="sd-form-card" data-ga-section="form">
          <h2 class="sd-section-title">Where are you looking?</h2>
          <p class="sd-section-sub">Takes half a minute. The snapshot is free.</p>
          <form id="sd-inv-form" novalidate>
            <div class="sd-field">
              <label for="f_city">City</label>
              <select id="f_city" required>
                <option value="" disabled selected>Pick your city</option>
                <option>Pune</option><option>Bengaluru</option><option>Mumbai</option>
                <option>Delhi</option><option>Hyderabad</option><option value="Other">Somewhere else</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="sd-field">
              <label for="f_budget">Rough budget</label>
              <select id="f_budget" required>
                <option value="" disabled selected>How much are you planning to spend?</option>
                <option>Under ₹40L</option><option>₹40L to ₹70L</option><option>₹70L to ₹1.2Cr</option><option>Above ₹1.2Cr</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="sd-field">
              <label for="f_purpose">Are you buying to live in it or as an investment?</label>
              <select id="f_purpose" required>
                <option value="" disabled selected>Choose one</option>
                <option value="self">To live in</option>
                <option value="invest">As an investment</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <p class="sd-note sd-hidden" id="sd-form-error" role="alert" style="color:#b42318;text-align:left">Please fill in all three so we can show you something useful.</p>
            <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: flex-end">
              <button class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" type="submit" data-ga-name="investment_submit">Show the snapshot</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>
        <section class="sd-panel sd-hidden" id="sd-result-card" data-ga-section="result" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="sd-result-head">
            <span class="sd-badge">Your free snapshot</span>
            <h2 class="sd-section-title" id="sd-result-title" tabindex="-1">Here's the quick picture</h2>
            <p class="sd-section-sub">Rough, indicative numbers to help you get your bearings. Not live market data.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="sd-recos"></div>
          <div class="sd-upsell" data-ga-section="upsell">
            <h3>Want the full price-trend report?</h3>
            <p>A three-year price trend for your localities, a fair-price range for your budget, and the questions to ask before you sign anything.</p>
            <div class="sd-price">₹500 – ₹1,000</div>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-green" href="/request-received/?for=property_report" data-ga-event="upsell_click" data-ga-name="property_report_cta" data-ga-product="property_report" data-ga-price="500-1000">Get the detailed report</a>
            <small>One report, one payment. We can also put you in touch with a listed broker if you want.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-handoff" data-ga-section="next_step">Buying a home? It's worth protecting too. <a href="/smart-decisions/insurance/" data-ga-name="investment_to_insurance">See what insurance you'd need →</a></div>
          <%# Sign-in prompt switched OFF: results pages no longer send people to
              the login page. To bring it back, move the block below out of this
              comment and uncomment the matching lines in the page's script.js.

          <div class="sd-handoff sd-hidden" id="sd-signin-hint" data-ga-section="signup_prompt">
            Want a nudge when prices move in your area?
            <a id="sd-signin-link" href="/login/" data-ga-event="signup_prompt_click" data-ga-name="investment_signup_prompt">Create a free profile →</a>
          </div>
          -%>
          <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-restart" data-ga-name="form_start_over">Check another area</button>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-name="see_all_smart_decisions">See all Smart Decisions</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/db/dbconfig.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/mainfiles/smart-decisions/investment/script.js?v=<%= platform_version %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
